description.narrative:
People and Nature Reconciliation (PanNature) is a Vietnamese not-for-profit organization. Established by a diverse group of dedicated Vietnamese environmental professionals, PanNature thinks creatively about solving the most salient environmental issues facing Vietnam. PanNature was established in late 2004 and successfully registered as a not-for-profit organization in January 2006.

PanNature has major responsibilities as follows:

(1) Conducting researches in areas related to the environment, nature conservation, poverty reduction, and sustainable development;
(2) Carrying out activities, programs, and projects in the fields of environmental protection, nature conservation, poverty reduction, and sustainable development;
(3) Disseminating scientific and technical information related to environmental protection, nature conservation, and sustainable development;
(4) Providing scientific and technical services, consultancy, training, workshop and conference organization in above fields;
(5) Mobilizing and diversifying resources to contribute to environmental protection, nature conservation, and sustainable development;
